# Secrets & Scripts
.env
# Browser cookie exports hold LIVE Google/YouTube session tokens. Glob, not a single
# filename: cookies_yt2.txt was created 2026-07-20 and was NOT covered by the old
# literal, so `git add .` would have committed live tokens to a public repo.
cookies*.txt
*cookies*.txt
# git_push.sh is tracked ON PURPOSE (token-free — it sources creds from .env). Do NOT ignore it.

